# Linux patch series for libplacebo, applied by platforms/linux/build.sh to the
# pin in overrides.linux. One pool filename per line; order is authoritative.
#
# Shared with series.android (see there for why this is not series.common).
# The linux build is OpenGL-only (-Dvulkan=disabled), and on a GLES context --
# the aarch64 boards whose EGL offers no desktop GL -- this patch is the only
# way an array too large for plain uniforms reaches the shader at all; desktop
# GL is untouched.
0002-opengl-enable-ubos-on-gles.patch
